  },
  {
   "en": "<strong>Lónyay utca, District IX.</strong> A smaller side street away from the District VII party streets. Street noise was minimal across my 30 nights.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">Kálvin tér (M3, M4) and Fővám tér (M4, trams 2, 47, 49) are a short walk.</span>",
